              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}C&=\\frac{5}{9}(27-32)\\\\C&=\\frac{5}{9}\\times(-5)\\\\C&=-\\frac{25}{9}\\\\C&=-2\\frac{7}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
